      "json": [
        {
          "text": "I can use similar air magic to when I slow my falling speed to "
        },
        {
          "text": "push things away from me",
          "color": "dark_purple"
        },
        {
          "text": ". This might be a good spell in a pinch when another creeper sneaks up on me, if I'm fast enough.\n\nIn fact, it can cause rather "
        },
        {
          "text": "significant damage if I fling something into a wall",
          "color": "dark_purple"
        },
        {
          "text": ".  That includes me.  I've heard there is an "
        },
        {
          "text": "artifact",
          "color": "blue"
        },
        {
          "text": " powerful wizards can create that "
        },
        {
          "text": "protects them from this damage",
          "color": "blue"
        },
